<title>NETHERLANDS: Wegener Arcade sees profit up in 1997.</title>
<headline>Wegener Arcade sees profit up in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wegener Arcade said on Friday it expected its net profit and its earnings per share to continue to rise in 1997.</p>
<p>It said the rises would result from organic growth and past and future acquisitions, barring unforeseen circumstances.  </p>
<p>In newspapers, Wegener said it expected growth in advertising volumes as well as a lower price of paper.</p>
<p>In the music sector, the company said it did not rule out another acquisition. Last week, Wegener took over French record labelt Flarenasch.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
